        },
        {
          "as": "\\(250\\,\\mathrm{cm^2}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explanation": {
        "as": "\\(2(l+b)=50\\Rightarrow l+b=25\\)। প্ৰস্থ = \\(25-15=10\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\)। কালি = \\(15\\times10=150\\,\\mathrm{cm^2}\\)।"
